# The Docker build context (website/Dockerfile, docker-compose.yml) is the repository's root, but the docs site is
# built from website/ alone: everything else stays out (models, recordings, build output, the trailer's videos).
*
!website/
website/node_modules/
website/.site/
website/docs/.vitepress/dist*/
website/docs/.vitepress/cache/
**/.DS_Store
